    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink": "瞬移",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.description": "使用時將佩戴者向前傳送最多 %1$s 格，消耗內部緩衝區中的 1 個單位（上限 %2$s）。緩衝區每隔 %3$s 秒自動恢復 1 個單位。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.blink": "每次執行瞬移獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.flicker": "瞬移期間每使一個目標失去視野，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.experience_source.safe_fall": "瞬移後每次安全著陸獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.ascent": "看著觸及範圍內的方塊進行傳送時，會傳送至該方塊而非前方。若目標上方有其他方塊，則使用剩餘的傳送距離尋找安全的落腳點。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.flicker": "傳送時，附近所有目標會短暫失去玩家的視野。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.rank_modifier.safe_fall": "傳送後的著陸不會造成墜落傷害。",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.blinks_amount": "總瞬移次數",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.distance_traveled": "瞬移移動的總距離",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.safe_falls": "瞬移後的安全著陸次數",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.ability.blink.statistic.targets": "因瞬移而失去佩戴者視野的目標總數",
    "relics.description.chorus_staff.description": "一截從遙遠終界島嶼奪取的奇特頌歌植物枝條。多年之後，它仍保有傳送之力：輕輕一揮，身體便會消失，轉瞬出現在另一個未知的地點。",
    "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass": "琉璃化",
    "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.description": "當手持此遺物時，其功能如同普通桶子，能儲存最多 %2$s 種液體，總容量為 %1$s mB。手持遺物並按住 Shift 同時滾動滾輪可切換液體。裝備此遺物後，允許在內部緩衝區儲存的任何液體上移動。在液面移動速度僅為平常的一半，但每儲存 1000 mB 的同類液體，該液面上的移動速度提升 %3$s%%。",
    "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.experience_source.standing": "在液面上移動每秒獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.ability.glass.statistic.duration": "站在液面上的總時間",
    "relics.description.cut_glass_boot.description": "這雙靴子由一位試圖將海洋囚禁於刻面器皿中的瘋狂玻璃工匠打造，由多層水晶雕琢而成，銘記著曾觸碰其壁面的每一滴水。隨著時間推移，玻璃不再只是儲存液體，而是學會了操控它：一旦靴子被填滿，水面、岩漿、毒液或其他液體都會在佩戴者的腳下凝固，如鏡面之橋般延伸。",
    "relics.description.general.cost.title": "消耗",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack": "狼群之影",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.description": "提升佩戴者寵物造成的傷害 %1$s%%。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.bone_drop": "寵物戰死產生骨頭時獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.pet_damage": "佩戴者的寵物每進行一次攻擊，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.experience_source.pet_resistance": "透過寵物保護機制減免的每點傷害獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.leader": "%2$s 格內的寵物每隻會使佩戴者受到的傷害減少 %3$s%%，上限為 5 隻。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.relentless": "佩戴者的寵物將無視目標的受傷無敵幀（I-frames）。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.rank_modifier.revival": "寵物死亡時掉落特殊的骨頭，可透過擊殺生物充能（充能值等於生物的最大生命值）。復活寵物需消耗其最大生命值 %4$s%% 的充能點。",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.damage_resisted": "寵物保護機制吸收的總傷量",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_attacks": "寵物攻擊次數",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_bones": "因寵物戰死而產生的骨頭總數",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.ability.pack.statistic.pet_damage": "寵物造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.hunting_belt.description": "獵人們佩戴此腰帶，不僅仰賴自己的雙手，更信賴夥伴的獠牙。磨損的皮革與骨製護符承載著數十場共同戰鬥的記憶。腰帶加強了主人與寵物間的連結，將他們化為單一且致命的狼群。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration": "水生再生",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.description": "增加遺物佩戴者的最大生命值 %1$s%% 與生命恢復速度 %2$s%%，但僅在處於液體中或淋雨時生效。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.experience_source.health_regeneration": "每恢復一點生命值，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.rank_modifier.retention": "離開水域後，額外生命值加成會被替換為吸收傷害的「傷害吸收心（黃心）」。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.regeneration.statistic.health_regenerated": "已恢復的生命值",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock": "電力釋放",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.disabled.description": "此能力已關閉，不提供任何加成。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.enabled.description": "每隔 %1$s 秒累積一次電弧電荷，最高累積 %2$s 個電荷。當遺物佩戴者觸碰任何生物時，會消耗 1 個電弧電荷，使 %3$s 格內的所有目標以 %4$s%% 的力量被擊退、麻痺 %5$s 秒，並觸發一段在 %6$s 格內的目標間彈跳最多 %7$s 次的連鎖閃電，對路徑上的一切造成 %8$s 點傷害。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.experience_source.arcs_bouncing": "電弧每次彈跳，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.experience_source.hit_paralysis": "攻擊使目標麻痺的每一秒，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.experience_source.rings_accumulating": "每生成一個電弧電荷，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.mode.disabled": "已停用",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.mode.enabled": "已啟用",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.rank_modifier.charge": "當能力觸發時，佩戴者在接下來的 %10$s 秒內，其攻擊將能使目標麻痺 %5$s 秒。麻痺僅對該次觸發期間尚未被此機制麻痺過的目標生效。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.rank_modifier.conductor": "連鎖閃電對處於液體中或淋雨的目標造成的傷害增加 %9$s%%。",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.arcs_bounces": "連鎖閃電彈跳次數",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.arcs_damage": "連鎖閃電造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.arcs_spawned": "已創造連鎖閃電數",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.hit_paralysis": "攻擊造成的麻痺總時間",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.rings_accumulated": "累計累積電弧電荷數",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.ability.shock.statistic.rings_paralysis": "電弧爆炸造成的麻痺總時間",
    "relics.description.jellyfish_necklace.description": "如同活生生的裝飾般纏繞於頸間，即便遠離家鄉水域，這隻水母也不會枯萎。它半透明的傘緣輕柔搏動，變幻著大海的色調，纖細的觸手時而輕輕搖曳，時而收縮並釋放出電火花。當佩戴者沉浸於水中時，它會以自身的生命力為代價，維持主人的生命與健康。但當敵人靠近時，觸手會爆發出炫目的放電，電擊波將橫掃路徑上的一切。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding": "滑翔",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.disabled.description": "此能力已關閉，不提供任何加成。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.enabled.description": "按住跳躍鍵時，減少佩戴者的重力與空氣阻力，並增加 %1$s%% 的移動慣性。使用此能力時墜落傷害也會降低，但其減傷效果與佩戴者的垂直移動速度成反比。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.experience_source.gliding": "滑翔每持續一秒，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.experience_source.resistance": "來自修正符的每點抵免傷害，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.experience_source.strike": "來自修正符的每點額外傷害，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.mode.disabled": "已停用",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.mode.enabled": "已啟用",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.rank_modifier.momentum": "在墜落前使用此能力可免除所有潛在墜落傷害，並保留衝能供下次跳躍使用。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.rank_modifier.resistance": "在使用此能力期間，減少佩戴者受到的傷害 %3$s%%。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.rank_modifier.strike": "在使用此能力期間，增加佩戴者造成的遠程投射物傷害 %2$s%%。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.statistic.damage": "滑翔期間造成的總額外傷害",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.statistic.duration": "總滑翔時間",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.gliding.statistic.resistance": "滑翔期間抵免的總傷害",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.slots": "軍火庫擴張",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.ability.slots.description": "增加 %1$s 個護身符的最大裝備上限。",
    "relics.description.kinetic_belt.description": "這條腰帶曾屬於一位空中藝術大師，他同時也是古老氣靈學派的傳人。腰帶由違背常理物理定律的材料製成，織入布料中的薄板並非感應體重，而是感應「動作」——彷彿大氣本身都聽命於佩戴者。掌握此遺物的人描述這是一種與空氣幾乎完全融合的感覺：每一步都化為躍進，每一躍都化為飛行，而每一次墜落，都僅僅是為下一次起飛所做的蓄力。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage": "偽裝",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.description": "允許在樹葉間自由移動，且降落在樹葉上時免受墜落傷害。處於葉叢中時，佩戴者每秒可恢復 %1$s 點生命值。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.experience_source.healing": "偽裝時每恢復一點生命值獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.experience_source.hiding": "在葉叢中躲藏每秒獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.rank_modifier.absorption": "當能力觸發時，佩戴者獲得 %2$s 點額外的傷害吸收生命（黃心）。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.rank_modifier.disappearance": "在能力持續期間獲得隱身效果，但任何與世界的交互（如攻擊、採集）會使其失效 %3$s 秒。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.statistic.heal_amount": "偽裝時恢復的總生命值",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.camouflage.statistic.hide_duration": "在葉叢中偽裝的總時間",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival": "林地之禮",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.description": "受到致命傷害時，斗篷會吸收半徑 %1$s 格內的葉片以保護佩戴者免於死亡。吸收的葉片量取決於受到的致命傷害值，每 1 個樹葉方塊可抵銷最多 %2$s 點傷害。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.experience_source.consuming_leaves": "每吸收一個樹葉方塊，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.experience_source.leaves_impact": "葉片投射物每命中一個目標，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.rank_modifier.piercing": "發散出的葉片投射物造成 %3$s 點傷害，並使路徑上所有目標麻痺 %4$s 秒。",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.damage_dealt": "葉片投射物造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.damage_negated": "由樹葉抵銷的總傷害",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.leaves_consumed": "累計吸收樹葉方塊數",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.ability.revival.statistic.paralysis_duration": "葉片投射物造成的總麻痺時間",
    "relics.description.leafy_mantle.description": "這件斗篷由千片長青葉交織而成，卻如正午的樹蔭般輕盈。它披在佩戴者的肩頭，使其融入森林，避開窺探。布料中的葉片搏動著生命能量養育身體，而在致命危險時刻，林地本身將起而防禦，以揮舞的枝幹撥開任何攻擊。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation": "星座",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.description": "受到傷害有 %1$s%% 的機率向隨機方向釋放一顆星星，它會與 %2$s 格內的其他星星連成星座。越過星座連線會使目標震顫 %3$s 秒；觸碰星星則會立即使其爆炸，對 %4$s 格內的所有目標造成 %5$s 點傷害。星星在出現 %6$s 秒後會自動爆炸。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_creation": "每創造一顆星星獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_damage": "星星造成的每點傷害獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.experience_source.star_tremor": "星座連線使目標震顫每秒獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.rank_modifier.stun": "星星爆炸還會使目標暈眩 %7$s 秒。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.star_damage": "星星造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.star_stun": "星星造成的總暈眩時間",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.constellation.statistic.total_stars": "累計創造星星數",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility": "暗影",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.description": "當光照等級低於 %1$s%% 時，將佩戴者披上陰影並賦予隱身效果。離開陰影后，此能力在 %2$s 秒內無法再次觸發，且在 16 格內所有目標完全失去佩戴者視野前也無法觸發。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.experience_source.being_invisible": "隱身每秒獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.experience_source.damage_dealing": "從隱身狀態造成的每點額外傷害獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.rank_modifier.strike": "從暗影中發動的攻擊造成的傷害提升 %3$s%%。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.statistic.additional_damage": "隱身期間造成的總額外傷害",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.invisibility.statistic.duration": "總隱身時間",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase": "月相",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.experience_source.damage_dealing": "在新月模式下每恢復一點額外生命獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.experience_source.health_regeneration": "在滿月模式下每造成一點額外傷害獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.full_moon.description": "增加佩戴者造成的傷害 %1$s%% 與攻擊速度 %2$s%%。加成效果取決於目前月相與「滿月」的接近程度。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.mode.full_moon": "滿月",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.mode.new_moon": "新月",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.new_moon.description": "增加佩戴者的最大生命值 %3$s%% 與生命恢復速度 %4$s%%。加成效果取決於目前月相與「新月」的接近程度。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.rank_modifier.switch": "切換能力模式後 %5$s 秒內，效果提升 %6$s%%。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.additional_damage": "總額外傷害",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.duration_full_moon": "處於滿月模式的時間",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.duration_new_moon": "處於新月模式的時間",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.phase.statistic.health_regeneration": "總額外生命恢復",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall": "星落",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.description": "當佩戴者造成傷害時，有 %1$s%% 的機率召喚一顆墜星，著陸時產生半徑 %2$s 格的衝擊波，造成初始傷害 %3$s%% 的傷害並使目標暈眩 %4$s 秒。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.shockwave_hit": "墜星衝擊波每命中一個目標獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.star_bounce": "墜星每彈跳一次獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.experience_source.star_creation": "每創造一顆墜星獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.rank_modifier.bounce": "有 %5$s%% 的機率使墜星從表面彈起而不毀滅。每次彈跳衝擊波半徑減少 1。此效果可觸發多次。",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_damage": "墜星衝擊波造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_stun": "墜星衝擊波造成的總暈眩時間",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.shockwave_targets": "墜星衝擊波命中目標總數",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.star_bounces": "墜星彈跳總次數",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.ability.starfall.statistic.total_stars": "累計召喚墜星數",
    "relics.description.midnight_mantle.description": "這件由陰影與星光織就的斗篷，是失落月之祭司的遺物。他們不從月光，而是從永恆變幻的天空中汲取力量。據說其布料隨月相更迭：新月時寒如靜寂之夜，滿月時則搏動著深沉光輝。敢於穿上它的人描述自己彷彿化為滑行於世界縫隙間的黑暗，力量隨月升月落而增減。他們發誓，面對危險時，斗篷的反應比意識更快：衣袖中散落閃爍群星，蒼穹以熾熱的光芒回應威脅。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter": "以物易物",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.description": "交易時，豬靈針對單一貨幣會回饋最多 %1$s 個交易結果。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.experience_source.pickup": "豬靈每拾取一個額外貨幣，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.experience_source.trade": "與豬靈每次交易，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.rank_modifier.pocket": "交易前，豬靈可能會立即從佩戴者身上額外收取最多 %2$s 個貨幣。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.statistic.currency": "與豬靈交易消耗的貨幣總量",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.barter.statistic.items": "從豬靈交易獲得的物品總量",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting": "掠奪",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.description": "擊殺目標會掉落額外的「金牙」。掉落量取決於目標的最大生命值，每 %2$s 點生命值有 %1$s%% 的機率掉落一顆金牙。金牙可用於豬靈交易或熔煉成黃金。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.experience_source.drop": "每掉落一顆金牙，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.experience_source.stack": "透過金牙獲得的每次加成疊層，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.rank_modifier.frenzy": "拾取掉落的金牙後，每顆金牙會使傷害提升 %4$s%%、攻擊速度提升 %5$s%%，持續 %3$s 秒。拾取新金牙會重設持續時間。當累積達 32 顆時，再次拾取將不再重設時間，而是使所有加成變為三倍，直到時間結束。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.additional_damage": "金牙效應下造成的額外傷害",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.effect_duration": "處於金牙效應下的總時間",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.teeth_dropped": "目標掉落的金牙總數",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.teeth_picked_up": "拾取的金牙總數",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.looting.statistic.tripled_effect_duration": "處於三倍金牙效應下的總時間",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality": "中立",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.description": "豬靈不再主動攻擊遺物佩戴者。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.experience_source.target": "豬靈每次保護佩戴者，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.rank_modifier.legion": "附近的豬靈會攻擊任何試圖傷害佩戴者或被佩戴者攻擊的目標。",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.ability.neutrality.statistic.target": "曾保護過佩戴者的豬靈數量",
    "relics.description.piglin_mask.description": "誕生於地獄，雕刻細膩的豬靈面容面具。戴上它，任何生物無論對地獄多麼陌生，都能被豬靈視為同類。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection": "傷害凝縮",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.description": "當遺物佩戴者受到傷害時，有 %1$s%% 的機率產生一個儲存了 %2$s%% 受傷數值的能量球。當佩戴者攻擊時，方圓 16 格內的所有能量球會依序飛向被攻擊的目標。能量球在路徑上碰撞到任何目標時會造成儲存的傷害後消失。若碰撞到固體方塊，或在出現後 %3$s 秒內未選擇目標，能量球也會消失。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.experience_source.construct": "能量球每儲存相當於佩戴者 10% 最大生命值的傷害，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.experience_source.impact": "能量球每次命中目標，獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.rank_modifier.bounce": "能量球在撞擊固體表面或距離佩戴者超過 16 格時，最多可彈跳 %6$s 次。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.rank_modifier.piercing": "能量球在命中第一個目標後不再消失，而是會穿透路徑上最多 %4$s 個目標。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.rank_modifier.stun": "能量球對目標造成傷害時，也會使其暈眩 %5$s 秒。",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_bounces": "能量球彈跳次數",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_damage": "能量球造成的總傷害",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_orbs": "已創造能量球數",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.ability.reflection.statistic.total_stun": "能量球造成的總暈眩時間",
    "relics.description.reflective_necklace.description": "古老傳說記載，有一位珠寶大師能將戰鬥中的怒火囚禁於水晶之中。這條項鍊便是他為數不多的創作之一：石塊平滑的刻面能吸收打擊的力量並將其儲存，直到佩戴者決定將其歸還給敵人。在嫻熟的使用者手中，項鍊不僅是守護，更是能將任何敵意轉向其主人的強大武器。",
    "relics.description.relic.rankup.cost.entry_1": "%1$s 級遺物等級",
    "relics.description.relic.rankup.description": "重設所有累積的遺物與能力等級，以及任何未使用的能力升級點數。作為回報，這會提升遺物階級，從而增加其等級上限並改變某些能力的運作方式。",
    "relics.description.relic.rankup.max_rank": "遺物已達到最高階級，無法再提升！",
    "relics.description.relic.rankup.title": "遺物階級提升",
    "relics.description.relic.rankup.warning": "此動作會顯著影響遺物狀態。使用前請按住 [%1$s] 以確認你了解可能的後果！",
    "relics.description.relic.tooltip.abilities": "Abilities:",
    "relics.description.researching.ability.info.extra_info": "能力品質與遺物品質類似，是該能力所有屬性品質的平均值。這顯示了能力初始隨機數值距離最大理論值的距離。若要提高能力品質，你必須重新洗練其隨機屬性，直到獲得更好的數值。",
