    "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath": "憤怒",
    "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.description": "攻擊時會開啟一段 %1$s 秒的傷害視窗：起始時傷害提升 %2$s%%，隨後於中間點降至基礎值，最後於結束前降至最高 %3$s%% 的減損懲罰。發動新攻擊會重設此視窗。",
    "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.experience_source.timing": "在視窗期間改變的每點傷害獲得 +1 遺物經驗值。",
    "relics.description.ring_of_the_seven_deadly_sins.ability.wrath.statistic.bonus_damage": "傷害視窗期間獲得的額外總傷害",
